    "image_with_text_YFy6rM": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_4W4pwU": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Classic Pillar White Candles for Weddings & Events",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_7FLkyj": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>White pillar candles have long been a staple in weddings, ceremonies, and formal celebrations. Their serene glow adds warmth and intimacy to every moment, from walking down the aisle to raising a toast. These tall white candles are perfect for lining pathways, accenting reception tables, or adding a soft touch to your altar or photo area. Their neutral tone pairs beautifully with any color scheme, from soft pastels to deep jewel tones.</p><p>Because they’re unscented and dripless, our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles\">pillar candles</a> are ideal for indoor and outdoor venues alike. They stay neat and polished throughout long events—no mess, no fuss. Planning a wedding, anniversary, or upscale gathering? Browse our premium white pillar collection and get event-ready with elegance that never fades.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_4W4pwU",
        "border_7FLkyj",
        "text_G7eEn9"
      ],
