    "image_with_text_jFC67D": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_mckbY9": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Minimalist & Elegant – The Beauty of White Pillars",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_i6tgzQ": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_hUYJ6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you love clean, balanced spaces, white pillar candles are the perfect decorative accent. Their simple silhouette and classic white color bring a calm, minimalist aesthetic to any room. Whether displayed alone for a quiet moment of stillness or grouped for dramatic effect, these candles add understated beauty without the clutter.</p><p>They’re equally at home on a rustic wooden table, a sleek modern shelf, or an ornate fireplace mantel. With their timeless appeal, tall white candles blend into every season and design style—ideal for both everyday décor and memorable moments. Add them to your space today and let your décor glow with quiet confidence.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_mckbY9",
        "border_i6tgzQ",
        "text_hUYJ6B"
      ],
