    "image_with_text_dNbdM3": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_tU6rmL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why Choose Kisco’s Tall White Pillar Candles",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_Afnn3H": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_kepcYj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choosing the right candle matters, especially when appearance, performance, and reliability count. At Kisco Candles, we take pride in offering tall white pillar candles that look stunning and burn beautifully. Our premium wax formula delivers a long-lasting, dripless flame that stays consistent and clean from start to finish.</p><p>Every candle is crafted for stability, so it stands tall without bending, melting unevenly, or creating unsightly wax trails. We also offer a variety of sizes, so you can create dynamic arrangements with confidence. </p><p>Shopping for a large event or restocking your venue? Take advantage of our bulk discounts, free nationwide shipping, and hassle-free returns. Order now and elevate your candle game with quality you can count on.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_tU6rmL",
        "border_Afnn3H",
        "text_kepcYj"
